<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 1.1 billion.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 1.1 billion.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 91-day treasury bills worth 1.1 billion pounds for auction on June 25 and issue on June 26 when 91-day bills worth 665.300 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 8.958 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
</text>
